menuconfig POX_KERNEL
	bool "Pox Kernel Core Subsystem"
	default y
	help
	  Enables the Pox Kernel core subsystem providing unified procfs
	  and sysfs interfaces for Pox Kernel Manager: Gaming Mode,
	  Kprofiles governor integration, Battery Protection, True Tone
	  Display calibration, BORE scheduler controls, and atomic Pox Config.
